  "excerpt": "[docs/cli.md#pskit-resources-onprem]\nDeleting a deployed resource runs `terraform destroy -target=...`. If it is still in `pskit.yml`, the next deploy creates it again, so remove it from `resources:` (or the trigger) first. Kept resources are deleted from their own small workspace in `.pskit/<provider>-<stage>/kept/`, which is removed when the last one is gone. Credentials are the same as for `pskit deploy`.",
